sary-to-DG","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"bcc8617a80cfd7ba71c22e3c44e52e5f05ca884d","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Update Glossary for DG","messageBody":"Fix minor clarifications of (home) nurse.\r\nFIx weird character in Address Glossary field.","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"docs":{"insertions":3,"deletions":3}}},{"hash":"15609e1af4ef5e6c1a904960d3b6f07554b4aee6","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Add non functional requirements to DG","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"docs":{"insertions":8,"deletions":2}}},{"hash":"d50deb4ef42733a2ad7e908fcf615929fadc634d","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Update Mainstream OS Glossary for DG","messageBody":"Include Mainstream OS definition back into DG","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"docs":{"insertions":1,"deletions":0}}},{"hash":"b59e6992c533e95f5fe2045d16cc35fe28ef7741","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Update NFR in DG","messageBody":"Change bullet no. 5 to remove duplication in no. 2","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"docs":{"insertions":1,"deletions":1}}}]},{"date":"2026-10-07T00:00:00","commitResults":[{"hash":"9649b5928a7c7fa9132b239476f0ad17dd554620","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #55 from dardenren/update-list-command","messageBody":"Update list command","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}}]}],"Bruhmiuz":[{"date":"2026-10-01T00:00:00","commitResults":[{"hash":"c4d020db493a87bc4c089c1f34510715d287ba7f","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #18 from less413/add-photo","messageBody":"Add less413 photo","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"7107ed70f16162d94ae379c4ca34114c7f05cb96","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #13 from Anthony-QIN-fz/12-update-fangzheng-about-us","messageBody":"Update Fangzheng\u0027s AboutUs details","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"f52fa57f75dc8771c421e2c0f2737cdb91449f46","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Revert \"Update Fangzheng\u0027s AboutUs details\"","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"docs":{"insertions":3,"deletions":4}}},{"hash":"e56c8feb8168df604f41fd4970f58f863eaa5528","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #9 from Bruhmiuz/photo-me","messageBody":"Add Bruhmiuz\u0027s photo","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"18f273b0400bcae5aed032b712a25a9e53d2808d","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Update AboutUs with Bruhmiuz\u0027s details","messageBody":"Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 \u003cnoreply@anthropic.com\u003e\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"docs":{"insertions":5,"deletions":6}}}]},{"date":"2026-10-03T00:00:00","commitResults":[{"hash":"0a53bfefd3b49b17b8fffcc516949370d2704831","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Add patient fields to Person and identify patients by ID","messageBody":"Person now holds a PatientId (identity), Name, Phone, Address, and\noptional MedicalHistory and NextAppointment. Email and Tag are removed.\n\n* PatientId: 1-10 letters/digits, case-insensitive.\n* Name accepts any non-blank text; Phone allows digits, spaces, \u0027+\u0027\n  and \u0027-\u0027 with at least 3 digits.\n* Text fields are trimmed, have repeated whitespace collapsed, and are\n  stored in upper case, so values differing only in case are equal.\n* NextAppointment is yyyy-MM-dd or yyyy-MM-dd HH:mm, strictly validated.\n* isSamePerson compares IDs, so duplicates are detected by ID.\n* Model#findPersonById searches all persons, not just the filtered list.\n* Storage, sample data and test utilities are updated to match.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 \u003cnoreply@anthropic.com\u003e\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"functional-code":{"insertions":423,"deletions":292},"test-code":{"insertions":544,"deletions":246}}},{"hash":"ad6554d5b8a36d09905d257362ccb7f9f4c09494","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Update callers for the new Person fields","messageBody":"Compile-only changes so the app builds without Email and Tag. Add, Edit\nand the UI only gain what the new Person requires; the full commands\nare owned by their respective features.\n\n* Add takes an id/ prefix and leaves the optional fields empty.\n* ParserUtil gains parseId and loses the Email and Tag parsers.\n* Edit drops email and tags and keeps the ID and optional fields.\n* The person card shows the patient ID in place of email and tags.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 \u003cnoreply@anthropic.com\u003e\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"functional-code":{"insertions":47,"deletions":165},"test-code":{"insertions":129,"deletions":308}}},{"hash":"974dcc5b723023c3bff9b103e94fecf741477977","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Move TextNormalizer to commons/util","messageBody":"TextNormalizer holds no Person logic: it only trims, collapses\nwhitespace and upper-cases a string. AB3 keeps general string helpers\nin commons/util, so it sits better next to StringUtil than in\nmodel/person.\n\nThe class and its method become public, as the field classes that call\nit are now in another package.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 \u003cnoreply@anthropic.com\u003e\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"functional-code":{"insertions":12,"deletions":0},"other":{"insertions":4,"deletions":4}}},{"hash":"4752fe8d1b87a0774a6099afe2d25b10abe43989","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Add tests for TextNormalizer","messageBody":"Six Person field classes rely on TextNormalizer for equality and\nvalidation, but it has no tests of its own.\n\nCover null and blank input, trimming, whitespace collapsing, upper\ncasing, and that upper casing ignores the default locale.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 \u003cnoreply@anthropic.com\u003e\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"test-code":{"insertions":56,"deletions":0}}},{"hash":"bc05da446686fccb2502094bba7f083d0fc644db","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge branch \u0027master\u0027 into Add-Glossary-to-DG","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"da7f1417e1108284495a109e8996ce4ab47d6329","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Update DeveloperGuide.md","messageBody":"Change instances of \"client\" and \"person\" to \"patient\" for additional clarity. \r\n\r\nNote: a patient is still represented by a `Person` object, so instances referring to `Person` are not changed.","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"docs":{"insertions":9,"deletions":9}}},{"hash":"9d8498fd667c6c9739882690c15400b11e2d4a24","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #44 from ykteo000/Add-Glossary-to-DG","messageBody":"Add Glossary to DG","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"c824e78ca27b112bbf25798829e9793017779fa5","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Update user profile and value proposition in Developer Guide","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"docs":{"insertions":5,"deletions":6}}}]},{"date":"2026-10-05T00:00:00","commitResults":[{"hash":"0115567997fb7d07cb5cca24c3d49d3c93dbeda9","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #46 from less413/w8-parse-syntax","messageBody":"Add and update parser prefix syntax","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}}]}],"Anthony-QIN-fz":[{"date":"2026-09-30T00:00:00","commitResults":[{"hash":"c36b8a975c74c003a15b1aed2b43398c4443dcd3","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Update Fangzheng\u0027s AboutUs details","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"docs":{"insertions":4,"deletions":3}}},{"hash":"acd10a50e4ea11d822a2a8ca98e0086ad5d90e11","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Update DG\u0027s user stories","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"docs":{"insertions":7,"deletions":7}}}]},{"date":"2026-10-01T00:00:00","commitResults":[{"hash":"484f35b703beb3b8d58c7577215a09b7ad2166b8","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #20 from less413/update-docs","messageBody":"Update README.md and site-wide settings","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"1304229521744c750c52caaaafe8189ff4f5f155","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #24 from AY2627S1-CS2103T-F08-2/revert-13-12-update-fangzheng-about-us","messa